        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `profile_claims.py` that fetches and normalizes federated user profile claims using a concrete external provider, I will use the Google OAuth2 API as the external provider. This will involve importing the necessary libraries, setting up the OAuth2 client, and defining functions to fetch and normalize user profile claims. The provider will be identifiable through the import of the `google-auth` library and the use of Google-specific OAuth2 endpoints and scopes. </thinking>\n",
